// literal grammar is the same one, so `Number()` on the matched prefix returns
// exactly what the C library would — this is a shim, not an approximation.
// (`parseFloat` is not used: it accepts `Infinity` but not C's `inf`, and it
// would silently accept a prefix this regex is meant to define.)
